  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;小红&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">
小红 is a person who is actively involved in defining and working with various mathematical and computational problems. She is primarily known as a student or problem setter who has defined the concept of a "good array" (or "好数组"), which must not initially be a palindrome but should become one with exactly one element change. 小红 has been given arrays to analyze and has written a program to calculate the number of good subarrays within them. She has also posed problems related to constructing permutation or permutation-like structures with specific constraints. Additionally,小红 requested assistance with constructing a 3x3 determinant (3rd-order determinant) where each element has an absolute value not less than 1, and the determinant value equals a given variable x. In other contexts, 小红 is mentioned as the creator or worker with the "双生数组" (twin array) concept, aiming to calculate the minimum operation count to transform an array into a twin array. Furthermore, 小红 defined a special N x N matrix consisting only of characters '0' and '1', termed the "good matrix," and she is tasked with transforming a given matrix into this state through swapping operations under specific conditions. She is characterized as a proactive individual who defines concepts, poses problems, and seeks solutions or assistance in solving them.&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person who defines what constitutes a 'good matrix' and is trying to transform a given 01 matrix into a good matrix through operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Individual requesting judgment on the minimum cost of operation to make a XOR b equal to c."&lt;SEP&gt;"A person who is asked to help determine the minimum cost to make a XOR b equal to c, although details suggest the program was written assuming '小L' needed judging."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-35ba454db150409dfa2569afe0680c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8af7cfb62173340e7ef202c51be3c0d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbee70be3b8011ff77829977d78f0058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df85ce295d523e4b50f09ff04d5c7bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e9ce81e31f65b60ba40e243a8d1ba19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff1c9451165769991bdb3906da8d57d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fc77dbcd0a97d49a184217f891dcb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d4818f978c53c37b43ca5128a7e29f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f</data>
