    <node id="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The act of creating a 'good matrix' through character swapping operations represents an algorithmic event."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 (good matrix) is a specific type of matrix that meets certain conditions: even row and column counts of even length, and a specific pattern of 1's in the top-left quadrant with 0's in the other three quadrants."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is an event or a defined concept that represents a matrix satisfying specific conditions, namely having even row and column counts and specific distributions of 0s and 1s."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 represents a specific type of matrix event that meets certain conditions, including even dimensions and specific distribution of 0s and 1s."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is a specific state defined as an n x n matrix that satisfies certain conditions - having even dimensions and specific patterns of 0s and 1s."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c4c926060a3af4a149ab3816fc63a59e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbee70be3b8011ff77829977d78f0058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"矩阵 (matrix) is the central object in the problem, which needs to be transformed into a 'good' state."&lt;SEP&gt;矩阵在这里被拟人化，接受输入并需要被转换成特定格式。&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 is the event where a given 01 matrix needs to be transformed into a 'good matrix' by swapping adjacent characters."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 is an organizational concept used in the context of defining a structure with specific properties, particularly in relation to the problem of transforming it into a 'good matrix'."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵, or matrix, is a mathematical organization representing a rectangular array of elements, being the focus of transformation in this problem."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbee70be3b8011ff77829977d78f0058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32</data>
    </node>
