      <data key="d1">"Tokitsukaze is a character mentioned in the problem statement who has a sequence of integers and wants to find the expected value of a sequence's value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character mentioned in the problem statement who has a sequence of integers and wants to know the expected value of the sequence's value, specifically looking for the absolute expectation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who is riding on a dragon and can use the 'Dragon's Breath' attack to defeat monsters in a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who is using a dragon to perform a 'Dragon's Breath' attack against monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the Dragon's Breath attack to defeat monsters in a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who sits on a dragon and can use the 'Dragon's Breath' attack to defeat monsters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the 'Dragon's Breath' ability to defeat monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who sits on a dragon and can use 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters on a grid map."</data>
