    <node id="&quot;井字棋&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"井字棋 (Tic-Tac-Toe) is the game being played between 小L and 炸鸡. The text describes the rules of the game, the current state of a specific board (残局局面), and asks whether 小L can guarantee a win with the given privilege."&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋 (tic-tac-toe) is the game being played between 小L and 炸鸡, where players aim to get three in a row on a 3x3 grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋 is the event of playing the game tic-tac-toe, which involves players placing X's and O's on a 3×3 grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋 is the tic-tac-toe game being played between 小L and 炸鸡."|&gt;**&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋 refers to the game of tic-tac-toe being played between 小L and 炸鸡."&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋 refers to the game of tic-tac-toe being played by 小L and 炸鸡."&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋 (tic-tac-toe) is the game being played between 小L and 炸鸡. The game is described as having a 3x3 grid where players alternately place their marks, aiming to get three in a row."&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋 (tic-tac-toe) is the game being played where players aim to get three of their marks in a row (horizontally, vertically, or diagonally)."&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋 (tic-tac-toe) is the game being played by 小L and 炸鸡."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;残局局面&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 'residual board state' or 'midgame/endgame position' in the Tic-Tac-Toe game, which is the starting point for the analysis or problem solving."&lt;SEP&gt;"残局局面 (Incomplete game situation/Endgame position) refers to the specific state of the 3x3 tic-tac-toe board described in the question, where both players have the same number of pieces and the game is not yet decided."&lt;SEP&gt;"残局局面 refers to an ongoing or partially completed game state of tic-tac-toe that is being analyzed."&lt;SEP&gt;"残局局面 refers to the current state of the 3x3 tic-tac-toe board, which is a game state after some moves have been made but the game is not yet finished."|&gt;**&lt;SEP&gt;"残局局面 refers to the current state of the tic-tac-toe game, where both players have made an equal number of moves and the game has not yet been decided."&lt;SEP&gt;"残局局面 refers to the current state of the 棋盘, with an equal number of `X' and `O' pieces placed, but the game not yet finished."&lt;SEP&gt;"残局局面 is one of the two players in the tic-tac-toe game, using 'X' as their mark."&lt;SEP&gt;"残局局面 refers to the current state of the game, where both players have made the same number of moves and the game is not yet decided."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Tic-Tac-Toe Game is a game being played between 小L and 炸鸡 with specific rules and conditions, including the ability for 小L to take two consecutive moves in one turn."</data>
