    <node id="&quot;棋盘&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 3x3 grid used for the game of Tic-Tac-Toe, with cells represented by coordinates (i,j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 棋盘 (chessboard/board) is a 3x3 grid where players place their marks. It's described as taking the form s_{i,j} where i is the row index and j is the column index."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 is a 3x3 grid where the tic-tac-toe game is being played, with positions (i,j) representing cells from top to bottom and left to right."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 refers to the 3x3 grid where the tic-tac-toe game is played."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 refers to the 3x3 grid used in the game of 井字棋, where moves are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 is the 3×3 game board used for the tic-tac-toe game, with cells denoted by (i, j) coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 is the board used for the game of tic-tac-toe having 3x3 positions."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 is the 3x3 game board on which the game of 井字棋 is being played, with cells (i,j) representing its grid positions."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 (board) is the 3x3 grid where the tic-tac-toe game is played."</data>
