      <data key="d3">148.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both entities are players in the tic-tac-toe game, with 小L using 'X' marks and 炸鸡 using 'O' marks."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents in the 井字棋 event, with 炸鸡 granting 小L a special privilege."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are players in an ongoing game of 井字棋, directly competing with each other."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is playing tic-tac-toe with 炸鸡, and 炸鸡 has granted 小L the privilege to take two consecutive moves in one turn."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L about bit operation knowledge, indicating a teaching relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L about bitwise operations"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L two new types of operations: squaring and square root."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 teaches Little L new mathematical operations, establishing a mentorship relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 teaches 小L new mathematical operations, establishing a teacher-student relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 teaches new mathematical operations to 小L, establishing a teacher-student relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents playing against each other in the game of 井字棋."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and炸鸡 are opponents in the tic-tac-toe game, with炸鸡 granting小L a special privilege to make two consecutive moves eventually."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 granted小L the privilege to make two consecutive moves as a special condition in their tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are playing a game of tic-tac-toe against each other."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents playing the game of 井字棋 (Tic-Tac-Toe) against each other. 炸鸡, considering 小L a novice, granted them 特权 (Privilege)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents playing against each other in the game of 井字棋."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents playing against each other in the game of 井字棋."</data>
