      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 特权 (Privilege) is a rule modification applied to the standard game of 井字棋 (Tic-Tac-Toe), intended to address the perceived novice status of 小L."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井字棋&quot;" target="&quot;POSITION (I,J)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Each position on the board is a potential move in the tic-tac-toe game."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;残局局面&quot;" target="&quot;棋盘&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The current state of the game is represented by the 棋盘's configuration, described as a 残局局面."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;残局局面&quot;" target="&quot;落子&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 残局局面 is the result of both players having made an equal number of 落子 actions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;残局局面&quot;" target="&quot;胜利&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"胜利 is the potential outcome of the 残局局面, achieved by completing three in a row with one's棋子."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;残局局面&quot;" target="&quot;特权&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The existence of the 特权 (Privilege) modifies the strategic possibilities and potential outcomes within the specific 残局局面 (Incomplete game situation/Endgame position) of the 井字棋 game."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;棋盘&quot;" target="&quot;单元格&quot;">
      <data key="d3">29.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The grid is composed of individual 单元格, identified by coordinates (i,j), where棋子 can be placed during the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 consists of multiple 单元格 where moves are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"单元格s form the棋盘 grid structure for playing tic-tac-toe.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7</data>
